## Goal

The engine gets `summon_pile` (kind `"summonPile"`): several Units summoned into one unit zone as a §3.2 Stack pile, first listed at the bottom, so the top is fought first (the Drone Battleship). R1204's lethal guard already covers Units; this proves it on a pile, where it guards only while on top. Both are proved on fixtures with their edges (R1842000, R1842001), with §3.2, §4.4, §6.2 and §6.3 text. No state, event, prompt, action, client, AI or card change, so no golden trace moves and `classify` names no card.

